{"agent_id":"pp3g-jlse-validation-task-evidence-only-not-a-system-to-ship","agent_seq":24,"timestamp":"2026-08-06T02:55:24.516695278Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"931ad307-386e-4096-8e00-0d9a4388216f","comment_uuid":"6ae903d7-5740-46c7-982c-20422bcab459","author":"pp3g-jlse-validation-task-evidence-only-not-a-system-to-ship","content":"Completed: Independent adversarial review of #196 deliverable (research/toolregistry-lazy-mcp). Full static verification: re-derived all timings from raw epoch_ms logs (Test1 2807ms, Test2 2614/10/2639ms, Test3 14/17/7ms, Test4 1587ms+20ms kill, Test5 2665ms, baseline 2786/1453/5-9-3-5ms — all match report), verified every source citation against installed venv (list_changed zero-match incl _vendor; session.py:1088; client.py:691; stdio.py:56/75/128; connection.py:106; registration.py:90; NotificationOptions tools_changed=False), code-reviewed proxy/backend/tests. Verdict: deliverable PASS, claims corroborated. LIMITATION: live re-run blocked — reviewer role OpenCode permission map denies bash python (hook-config allows it); intervention logged tool_blocked; recommend operator/builder run tests/run_tests.py once or grant python to reviewer allowlist. Result posted --kind result on #200.","created_at":"2026-08-06T02:55:24.506253318Z","kind":"handoff","signed_by":"SHA256:dqJJxDfhYp2s0PbFtktYlMdwFUCtHuPimgtdoZJSG+g","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgi3Y7k6zLHSnYcebt0U8E4gaHZmVqfalyr69g11qwxm8AAAARY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWNvbW1lbnQAAAAAAAAABnNoYTUxMgAAAFMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAABAY1FQzksgqBv9x/6i/rZx0F50yZ/0ya6GxJ4wTt79j8YnNsMamM6KGSgT8LHVJ8vnuZ6hRBfHKBqbksTYFshUDg=="},"signed_by":"SHA256:dqJJxDfhYp2s0PbFtktYlMdwFUCtHuPimgtdoZJSG+g","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgi3Y7k6zLHSnYcebt0U8E4gaHZmVqfalyr69g11qwxm8AAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQKZgAF5P80HmrfCoi7Nd5LTN1PBv7MyA53u6bsu27a0QGF2TU7YT2pZXN4fyNN9K5nVhue2/XrPXbaJOCIywQwY="}
